    "text": "If the maximum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>, for which the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;is non-decreasing in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
