  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;is non-decreasing function in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, so&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>min</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now, maximum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
